    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "NVMe (nvme smart-log)",
      "description": "Per NVMe namespace from the nvme_metrics collector. used = vendor wear estimate (1.0 is end of rated life, it can exceed it); spare = remaining spare blocks, alarm when it drops to the threshold; unsafe shutdowns count power losses without a clean flush. Devices on hosts with nvme-cli older than 2.4 are missing here until the host reaches trixie.",
